# Installed tools copied into project folders
**/gtkwave64/

# Vivado regenerated project trees / block-design outputs
# generic: applies to every <project>.xpr tree, not just project_zed
*.gen/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
**/project_zed.gen/
**/project_zed.cache/
**/project_zed.hw/
**/project_zed.sim/
vivado_pid*.zip

# Eclipse/Vitis workspace (regenerated from XSA + src/ via platform.tcl)
**/workspace.zed/

# Exported hardware platform (regenerated via write_hw_platform)
**/xsa/

# Simulation waveform dumps (regenerated locally)
*.vcd

# Bulk reference/duplicate project copies
week3/codes/
week3/test/

# OS/editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local week5 reference photos and duplicate project archives
week5/KakaoTalk_*.jpg
week5/mul_4bit_uart.zip
week5/mul_4bit_uart.tar.xz

# Secrets - never commit
.env
.secrets/
*.token

# Vitis: platform tree and app build outputs are fully regenerated from
# mobilenetV2_hw.xsa + mobilenetV2_test/src/, and hold absolute paths of the
# machine that built them. Only the XSA and the app sources are tracked.
**/mobilenetV2_platform/
**/mobilenetV2_test/Debug/
**/mobilenetV2_test/_ide/
**/mobilenetV2_test/.cproject
**/mobilenetV2_test/.project
**/mobilenetV2_test/*.prj

# 보드 플래싱용 산출물은 예외로 추적한다 (project_mobilenetV2/boot/README.md 참고)
!project_mobilenetV2/boot/design_1_wrapper.bit

